{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05569","headline":"晚春诣苏州敬赠武员外 · 王湾","name":"晚春诣苏州敬赠武员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苏台忆季常，飞櫂历江乡。\n持此功曹掾，初离华省郎。\n贵门生礼乐，明代秉文章。\n嘉郡位先进，鸿儒名重扬。\n爰从姻娅贬，岂失忠信防。\n万里行骥足，十年暌凤翔。\n回迁翊元圣，入拜伫惟良。\n别业对南浦，羣书满北堂。\n意深投辖盛，才重接筵光。\n陋学叨铅简，弱龄许翰场。\n神驰劳旧国，颜展别殊方。\n际晓杂氛散，残春衆物芳。\n烟和疎树满，雨续小谿长。\n旅拙感成慰，通贤顾不忘。\n从来琴曲罢，开匣爲君张。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}